# example:
# {input}
#
# Extract the selected messages of the mailbox to files of an Internet message, and open them
# with the application that is associated with the file type.
#   The messages are written to the temporary folder of the session, and they stay there
#   until the app exits, because the viewer may read them later.
#   The command does nothing when no message is selected, or when no application is associated
#   with the file type.
